## C01 resolved inputs

Recorded by C01 and bound to its review. Locks: `Cargo.lock`, `pnpm-lock.yaml`,
`rust-toolchain.toml`, `docs/architecture/toolchain.json`,
`docs/architecture/inputs.lock.json`; the controller's dependency fingerprint
