<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Refined Native v2 — onboarding</title>
<script src="./support.js"></script>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
<style>body{margin:0} input:focus-visible,textarea:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,button:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #a33d15;outline-offset:2px} [data-theme="dark"] input:focus-visible,[data-theme="dark"] textarea:focus-visible,[data-theme="dark"] select:focus-visible,[data-theme="dark"] button:focus-visible{outline-color:#fe8019} button[data-inset-focus]:focus-visible{outline-offset:-4px}</style>
</helmet>
<div data-theme="{{theme}}" style="width: {{W}}px; height: {{H}}px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; background: {{t.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'SF Pro Text', system-ui, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 12px; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}};">

  <aside aria-label="Setup steps" style="width: {{railW}}px; flex-shrink: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; background: {{t.side}}; border-right: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; padding: {{railPad}}; box-sizing: border-box;">
    <sc-if value="{{showLights}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}"><div aria-hidden="true" style="display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 0 26px;">
      <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #ff5f57;"></span>
      <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #febc2e;"></span>
      <span style="width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; background: #28c840;"></span>
    </div></sc-if>
    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 28px; margin-top: {{brandTop}}px;">
      <span style="width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; background: {{t.acc}}; color: {{t.accInk}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{I.shield}}"></path></svg></span>
      <span style="min-width: 0;"><b style="font-size: 15px;">{{railTitle}}</b><br><span style="color: {{t.faint}};">{{railSub}}</span><sc-if value="{{railCtx}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><br><span style="display: inline-block; margin-top: 4px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.ink}}; line-height: 1.35; word-break: break-word;">{{railCtx}}</span></sc-if></span>
    </div>
    <ol style="list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px;">
      <sc-for list="{{steps}}" as="st" hint-placeholder-count="7">
        <li aria-current="{{st.cur}}" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; height: 40px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 8px; background: {{st.bg}};">
          <span style="width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1.5px solid {{st.bd}}; background: {{st.cbg}}; color: {{st.cfg}}; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;"><sc-if value="{{st.done}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{I.check}}"></path></svg></sc-if><sc-if value="{{st.notDone}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}">{{st.n}}</sc-if></span>
          <span style="flex-grow: 1; font-weight: {{st.w}}; color: {{st.fg}};">{{st.label}}</span>
          <sc-if value="{{st.opt}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><span style="font-size: 12px; color: {{t.faint}};">Optional</span></sc-if>
          <sc-if value="{{st.skipped}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><span style="font-size: 12px; color: {{t.faint}};">Skipped</span></sc-if>
        </li>
      </sc-for>
    </ol>
    <div style="margin-top: auto; display: flex; gap: 8px; padding: 12px; border-radius: 10px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.soft}}; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.5;"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px;"><path d="{{I.lock}}"></path></svg><span>Secrets go straight to the macOS Keychain. Tenant calls go only to your own tenant. Joining the Academy is optional and sends your account details and progress to Academy.</span></div>
    <button onClick="{{toggleTheme}}" style="margin-top: 10px; align-self: flex-start; height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.paper}}; color: {{t.soft}}; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;">{{themeName}} appearance</button>
  </aside>

  <div style="flex-grow: 1; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
    <main style="flex-grow: 1; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; padding: {{mainPad}}; box-sizing: border-box;">
      <div style="max-width: 860px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px;">

        <sc-if value="{{isWelcome}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{true}}">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; padding-top: 30px;">
            <span style="width: 72px; height: 72px; border-radius: 18px; background: {{t.acc}}; color: {{t.accInk}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="38" height="38" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{I.shield}}"></path></svg></span>
            <h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.02em;">Welcome to Prisma AIRS Desktop</h1>
            <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 680px; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: {{t.soft}};">This app is built entirely on Palo Alto Networks’ own public APIs: the same programmatic interfaces any application builder can use. Everything you will see here, from reading a tenant’s security posture to scanning a prompt, is an API call you could make yourself. It exists to show how much those interfaces make possible.</p>
            <p style="margin: 0; max-width: 680px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: {{t.soft}};">We will walk you through it: connect a tenant with the credentials an integration would use, pick the products you manage, check the connection, and optionally load starter test cases. It takes about five minutes, and you can change everything later.</p>
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-top: 6px;">
              <sc-for list="{{welcomeCards}}" as="wc" hint-placeholder-count="3"><div style="background: {{t.paper}}; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><span style="width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; background: {{t.accSoft}}; color: {{t.acc}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{wc.icon}}"></path></svg></span><b>{{wc.title}}</b><span style="color: {{t.soft}}; line-height: 1.45;">{{wc.text}}</span></div></sc-for>
            </div>
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px dashed {{t.rule}};"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{t.soft}}" stroke-width="1.8" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{I.download}}"></path></svg><span style="flex-grow: 1;"><b>Used Prisma AIRS Desktop 1?</b> <span style="color: {{t.soft}};">Bring over your tenants and saved cases instead of typing them again.</span></span><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><span style="font-size: 12px; color: {{t.faint}};">Not in this prototype</span><button disabled title="Import is not in this prototype" style="height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.faint}}; font: inherit; cursor: not-allowed;">Import from v1…</button></span></div>
          </div>
        </sc-if>

        <sc-if value="{{isTenant}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
            <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-end; gap: 12px;">
              <div><h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Connect your tenant</h1><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; color: {{t.soft}}; font-size: 14px;">This becomes a managed tenant. The credentials are the same OAuth 2.0 service account any integration uses with the Palo Alto Networks APIs; only the management credentials are required.</p></div>
              <button onClick="{{fillSample}}" style="margin-left: auto; border: 0; background: transparent; color: {{t.acc}}; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Use sample values</button>
            </div>
            <section style="background: {{t.paper}}; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><b style="font-size: 14px;">Tenant</b><span style="padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.soft}}; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Required</span></div>
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;">
                <label style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.soft}};">{{nameField.label}}<input autofocus value="{{nameField.value}}" onChange="{{nameField.on}}" placeholder="{{nameField.ph}}" type="text" aria-invalid="{{nameField.inv}}" aria-describedby="{{nameField.did}}" style="height: 32px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid {{nameField.bd}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;"><span id="{{nameField.did}}" style="font-weight: 400; color: {{nameField.hfg}};">{{nameField.msg}}</span></label>
                <sc-for list="{{tsgFields}}" as="fd" hint-placeholder-count="1"><label style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.soft}};">{{fd.label}}<input value="{{fd.value}}" onChange="{{fd.on}}" placeholder="{{fd.ph}}" type="{{fd.type}}" aria-invalid="{{fd.inv}}" aria-describedby="{{fd.did}}" style="height: 32px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid {{fd.bd}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;"><span id="{{fd.did}}" style="font-weight: 400; color: {{fd.hfg}};">{{fd.msg}}</span></label></sc-for>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.soft}};">Environment<div role="radiogroup" aria-label="Environment" style="display: flex; padding: 2px; border-radius: 8px; background: {{t.inset}}; width: fit-content;"><sc-for list="{{envs}}" as="en" hint-placeholder-count="3"><button role="radio" aria-checked="{{en.on}}" onClick="{{en.pick}}" style="height: 32px; padding: 0 14px; border: 0; border-radius: 6px; background: {{en.bg}}; box-shadow: {{en.sh}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">{{en.label}}</button></sc-for></div><span style="font-weight: 400; color: {{t.faint}};">Production tenants ask for confirmation before every change.</span></div>
                <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.soft}};">Region<select aria-label="Region" value="{{region}}" onChange="{{onRegion}}" style="height: 32px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid {{t.ctl}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;"><option value="United States">United States</option><option value="Europe">Europe</option><option value="Asia Pacific">Asia Pacific</option></select><span style="font-weight: 400; color: {{t.faint}};">Where the tenant's data lives. Matches the Strata Cloud Manager region.</span></div>
              </div>
            </section>
            <section style="background: {{t.paper}}; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
              <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><b style="font-size: 14px;">Management credentials · OAuth 2.0</b><span style="padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.soft}}; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Required</span><button onClick="{{toggleHelp}}" aria-expanded="{{helpStr}}" style="margin-left: auto; padding: 0; border: 0; background: transparent; color: {{t.acc}}; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Where do I find these?</button></div>
              <sc-if value="{{helpOpen}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><ol style="margin: 0; padding: 12px 14px 12px 32px; border-radius: 8px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.soft}}; line-height: 1.5; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;"><li>In Strata Cloud Manager, open Identity &amp; Access › Service accounts.</li><li>Create a service account with the roles for the products you will manage.</li><li>Copy the client ID and the secret shown once. The secret is stored in your Keychain here and never shown again.</li></ol></sc-if>
              <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px;">
                <sc-for list="{{credFields}}" as="fd" hint-placeholder-count="2"><label style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.soft}};">{{fd.label}}<input value="{{fd.value}}" onChange="{{fd.on}}" placeholder="{{fd.ph}}" type="{{fd.type}}" aria-invalid="{{fd.inv}}" aria-describedby="{{fd.did}}" style="height: 32px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid {{fd.bd}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;"><span id="{{fd.did}}" style="font-weight: 400; color: {{fd.hfg}};">{{fd.msg}}</span></label></sc-for>
              </div>
            </section>
            <sc-for list="{{optCards}}" as="oc" hint-placeholder-count="2">
              <section style="background: {{t.paper}}; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px;">
                  <span style="width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.soft}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{oc.icon}}"></path></svg></span>
                  <span style="flex-grow: 1;"><span style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;"><b style="font-size: 14px;">{{oc.title}}</b><span style="padding: 1px 7px; border-radius: 999px; background: {{t.inset}}; color: {{t.faint}}; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">Optional</span></span><span style="color: {{t.soft}};">{{oc.text}}</span></span>
                  <button onClick="{{oc.toggle}}" role="switch" aria-checked="{{oc.onStr}}" aria-label="{{oc.title}}" style="width: 38px; height: 22px; border: 0; border-radius: 999px; background: {{oc.track}}; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px {{oc.ring}}; position: relative; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0;"><span style="position: absolute; top: 3px; left: {{oc.knob}}px; width: 16px; height: 16px; border-radius: 50%; background: {{oc.knobBg}};"></span></button>
                </div>
                <sc-if value="{{oc.on}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}">
                  <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: {{oc.grid}}; gap: 12px; padding-left: 42px;">
                    <sc-for list="{{oc.fields}}" as="fd" hint-placeholder-count="1"><label style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 5px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; color: {{t.soft}};">{{fd.label}}<input value="{{fd.value}}" onChange="{{fd.on}}" placeholder="{{fd.ph}}" type="{{fd.type}}" aria-invalid="{{fd.inv}}" aria-describedby="{{fd.did}}" style="height: 32px; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0 10px; border: 1px solid {{fd.bd}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400;"><span id="{{fd.did}}" style="font-weight: 400; color: {{fd.hfg}};">{{fd.msg}}</span></label></sc-for>
                  </div>
                </sc-if>
              </section>
            </sc-for>
          </div>
        </sc-if>

        <sc-if value="{{isProducts}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
            <div><h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Which products will you manage?</h1><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; color: {{t.soft}}; font-size: 14px;">Pick the ones {{f.name}} uses. They appear in Home, Inbox and Administration. You can change this any time.</p></div>
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px;">
              <sc-for list="{{prodCards}}" as="pc" hint-placeholder-count="6">
                <button onClick="{{pc.toggle}}" role="checkbox" aria-checked="{{pc.onStr}}" style="position: relative; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; min-height: 176px; padding: 18px 20px; border: 1.5px solid {{pc.bd}}; border-radius: 12px; background: {{pc.bg}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; box-sizing: border-box;">
                  <span style="position: absolute; top: 14px; right: 14px; width: 20px; height: 20px; border-radius: 50%; box-sizing: border-box; border: 1.5px solid {{pc.cbd}}; background: {{pc.cbg}}; color: {{t.accInk}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><sc-if value="{{pc.on}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><svg width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{I.check}}"></path></svg></sc-if></span>
                  <span style="width: 36px; height: 36px; border-radius: 10px; background: {{pc.tileBg}}; color: {{pc.tileFg}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{pc.icon}}"></path></svg></span>
                  <span style="display: block; padding-right: 26px; line-height: 1.35;"><b style="font-size: 14px;">{{pc.name}}</b><sc-if value="{{pc.isNew}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><span style="display: inline-block; margin-left: 6px; vertical-align: 1px; line-height: 1.4; padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 999px; background: {{t.accSoft}}; color: {{t.acc}}; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700;">New</span></sc-if></span>
                  <span style="color: {{t.soft}}; line-height: 1.45;">{{pc.desc}}</span>
                  <span style="margin-top: auto; font-size: 12px; color: {{t.faint}};">{{pc.uses}}</span>
                </button>
              </sc-for>
            </div>
            <sc-if value="{{rtNoScan}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; border-radius: 8px; background: {{t.flagBg}}; line-height: 1.45;"><svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{t.flag}}" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true" style="flex-shrink: 0;"><path d="{{I.alert}}"></path></svg><span style="flex-grow: 1;">AI Runtime Security works without a scan API key, but the Playground and test runs need one.</span><button onClick="{{goTenantScan}}" style="height: 32px; padding: 0 12px; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.paper}}; color: {{t.ink}}; font: inherit; font-size: 12px; cursor: pointer;">Add a scan key</button></div></sc-if>
          </div>
        </sc-if>

        <sc-if value="{{isVerify}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}">
          <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px;">
            <div><h1 style="margin: 0; font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em;">Check the connection</h1><p style="margin: 4px 0 0; color: {{t.soft}}; font-size: 14px;">We save the credentials, get a token and confirm each product you picked, using only read calls. Nothing in {{f.name}} is changed. Each check below is a public API call you could make from your own code.</p></div>
            <sc-if value="{{vBanner}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><div role="status" style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: {{vbBg}};"><svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="{{vbFg}}" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{vbIcon}}"></path></svg><span style="flex-grow: 1;"><b style="font-size: 14px;">{{vbTitle}}</b><br><span style="color: {{t.soft}};">{{vbText}}</span></span><sc-if value="{{isFail}}" hint-placeholder-val="{{false}}"><button onClick="{{editCreds}}" style="height: 32px; padding: 0 14px; border: 0; border-radius: 7px; background: {{t.acc}}; color: {{t.accInk}}; font: inherit; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;">Edit credentials</button></sc-if></div></sc-if>
            <section style="background: {{t.paper}}; border: 1px solid {{t.rule}}; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;">
              <sc-for list="{{checks}}" as="ck" hint-placeholder-count="9">
                <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 18px; border-top: 1px solid {{ck.top}};">
                  <span style="width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 50%; background: {{ck.bg}}; color: {{ck.fg}}; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; flex-shrink: 0;"><svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{ck.icon}}"></path></svg></span>
                  <span style="flex-grow: 1; min-width: 0;"><b style="font-weight: 600;">{{ck.name}}</b><br><span style="color: {{ck.dfg}}; line-height: 1.45;">{{ck.detail}}</span></span>
